  [1mDesign[0m

  [1m1. Architecture and data flow[0m

  A new root-level [38;5;153msettings.js[39m, loaded by [38;5;153mindex.html[39m immediately before [38;5;153mapp.js[39m. It self-executes at load, resolves the
  current environment once, and publishes a frozen [38;5;153mwindow.AppSettings[39m. By the time [38;5;153mapp.js[39m runs, [38;5;153mAppSettings.apiBaseUrl[39m
  is populated — no async, no init call, no ordering hazard beyond script order in the HTML.

  Resolution order: [38;5;153mwindow.APP_ENV[39m if it names a known environment → else [38;5;153mlocation.hostname[39m looked up in a hostname map
  → else the [38;5;153mproduction[39m default.

